# 1. Introduction

This document explains how to assemble, configure, and test the complete HoloJARVIS system.

By following this guide, you will build a fully functional AI-powered holographic assistant capable of voice interaction, holographic display, computer vision, and remote computer automation.

---

# 2. Build Requirements

Before starting, make sure you have:

- Raspberry Pi 5
- Complete Bill of Materials (BOM)
- 3D Printed Enclosure
- Stable Wi-Fi Connection
- USB Keyboard
- USB Mouse
- HDMI Monitor (temporary for setup)
- MicroSD Card (32GB or larger)
- Raspberry Pi OS Image

Estimated build time:

- Hardware Assembly: 2–4 hours
- Software Installation: 1–2 hours
- Configuration & Testing: 1–2 hours

---

