# 6. Optical System Assembly

Install the optical components in the following order:

```
Top Cover

↓

45° Reflective Glass

↓

100mm Watch Glass

↓

100mm Convex Lens

↓

2.4" TFT LCD Display
```

Important:

- Keep all optical surfaces clean.
- Avoid fingerprints on the glass.
- Ensure the reflective glass is fixed at approximately 45°.
- Verify the display is centered under the lens.

