# 12. Troubleshooting

## Raspberry Pi Does Not Boot

- Verify power supply.
- Check SD card.
- Reflash Raspberry Pi OS.

---

## No Hologram

- Check TFT display.
- Clean optical glass.
- Verify lens alignment.

---

## Camera Not Working

- Verify CSI ribbon orientation.
- Enable camera support.
- Restart the system.

---

## No Audio

- Check amplifier wiring.
- Verify speaker polarity.
- Test software audio settings.

---

## Microphone Not Detected

- Verify I2S connections.
- Check GPIO wiring.
- Test recording device.

